  "body": "Auction: 1054B Beach Road, Torbay (Branch Office) on Tuesday 17 November 2026 at 1:30PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nMust Be Sold!!\r\n\r\nWalk to Waiake Beach | Freshly Renovated | 4 Bedrooms | 3 Bathrooms | Double Garage\r\n\r\nImagine living moments from the coast, with generous spaces for the whole family, an impressive oversized kitchen, flexible work-from-home options and a private outdoor entertaining area. Beautifully refreshed and full of possibilities, this versatile Torbay home offers a lifestyle opportunity you won't want to miss.\r\n\r\nSpace to Live, Work & Entertain\r\nFreshly updated with new carpet, fresh paint and renovated bathrooms, this two-level home combines modern comfort with exceptional versatility.\r\n\r\nThe lower level features an impressive oversized kitchen and an exceptionally spacious separate room with its own bathroom — ideal for extended family, guests or a home-based business.\r\n\r\nThe light-filled living area flows seamlessly to a private backyard and covered outdoor entertaining area, creating an inviting setting for relaxed afternoons and gatherings with family and friends.\r\n\r\nAdding further flexibility is a separate 2.2m x 5.3m sleepout, offering potential as a home office, creative studio or hobby space, subject to any required consents.\r\n\r\nThe double internal-access garage features a durable rubberised floor, providing practical space for parking, storage or hobbies.\r\n\r\nA Home That Works Around You\r\nThe owners operated a home-based business from the garage for many years. The garage roller door area has been enhanced with aluminium-framed glass sliding doors and windows, retaining the original structure while introducing greater light and functionality.\r\n\r\nWhether you're seeking a spacious family home, room for extended family or a property that accommodates working from home, this home offers a range of possibilities to suit your lifestyle.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the Best of Coastal Torbay\r\nLeave the car at home and stroll to beautiful Waiake Beach for a morning walk, a refreshing swim or a relaxing escape by the sea. Torbay village shops, cafés and everyday amenities are also within walking distance, allowing you to enjoy the relaxed East Coast Bays lifestyle with everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nGenuine Motivation — Must Be Sold!\r\nThe owners have moved into their newly built home and are committed to selling, with clear instructions for an unconditional auction. Their goal is to have the property sold before Christmas, creating a genuine opportunity for buyers ready to act.\r\n\r\nAuction: Tuesday, 17 November 2026, at 1:30pm\r\nVenue: Barfoot & Thompson, Torbay Branch\r\n\r\nThe owners are committed. The auction is set. Be ready to bid!\r\n\r\nContact me today to arrange your viewing and prepare for auction day.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
